<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-03T01:42:30.386Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 01:42:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces are searching for four soldiers missing after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince while President Bukele has deployed 2,000 Salvadoran troops, denying any airstrikes by his forces. Benin has pledged 2,000 troops to assist Haiti's fight against gangs, and Haitian gang leaders have written to the UN seeking mediation and dialogue with security forces. Haiti has graduated 1,189 new officers to strengthen anti-gang operations, and the presidential election has been postponed to July 2027 amid worsening hunger and high food prices. The United Nations reports 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOc0swV0Z5MkJuU21TY0xEaEY5QzdsbUFGLVRwYlBDaDA4Znp1VWpjc1prbUloNTc2U3JVbk02LVRGTzB4X3lSaVppbXJ3RWtLanhkcm9GQkdtU0xFR3ZSMWttdmNFSXNxcVZyeDJxWnlTbUhEU2pHNXNROTlCeXlYcGdjY0prSUs2YWtRVTZOSk00R2Y5WHFHajVZUW9rRWtDbTEwcDNscW9wVkZjUlI0czA2V3k4Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPakpnVkNUSmVJbTR3NXZscFJiRmQ1bzBTOGk0OE1YY0drZDh4OHNOQmJNbUpiakpYRzZ6bEd3S1FaOUd4Sm5TM3lzWWhJalNZOXhXUklTc25oZVY2TUpBVnUwc1RaRGoxcm80VlhSdXdXUjAxVGN2dHp3Tnp0YTNiZVlaYkM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Simple Flying&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQWGY3bjF4U25iU29nMnNnb1hhSjI5a0lNLUNLYUU5RUN4X2VPejhrM3FxRDlHaW9BMFFXcFlqZ3V2NS1OVmZCejZGUmpSMHl2UnZpOTE0WHlRV3dNeTdjdmsxNHhQVG5HSVU2NzlleDk5Y003UG5MQnA4N3JZUE1KRVktLUdOUGdYWVZhRjRsRmJKaHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;U.S. Embassy in Haiti (.gov)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Killeen Daily Herald&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eagle-Tribun